            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>EXPLANATION</p>",
            "readable_text": "EXPLANATION",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>To raise a power to another power, we simply multiply the exponents:</p><p> <span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\left(2\\cdot4^3\\right)^2=2^{2}\\cdot 4^{3\\cdot 2}=4 \\cdot 4^{6} =  4^{7}]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "To raise a power to another power, we simply multiply the exponents:\n\n[MATH: \\left(2\\cdot4^3\\right)^2=2^{2}\\cdot 4^{3\\cdot 2}=4 \\cdot 4^{6} = 4^{7}]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
        ],
        "images": [],
